  <Nav />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-section pt-40 sm:px-8">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal notice</p>
    <h1 class="text-display font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.025em]">Impressum</h1>
    <div class="prose-quoth mt-10 space-y-6 text-bone-dim">
      <p>Information in accordance with Section 5 DDG (German Digital Services Act).</p>
      <p>
        Samuel Ruairí Bullard<br />
        [Street and number]<br />
        [Postcode] [City]<br />
        Germany
      </p>
      <p>Email: [contact email]</p>
      <p>Responsible for content under Section 18 (2) MStV: Samuel Ruairí Bullard, address as above.</p>
      <p>Quoth is free software, published under the GNU GPL 3.0 or later. The source is available on <a class="text-bone underline decoration-ink-600 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-bone" href="https://github.com/abullard1/quoth" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
